JtVMpzclr78BJUPPDYdQhLgyuNi2pYDBteqPl6lkUTL+3ohoMkKntb9tQ8PhUN\/lpC\/KSqRWrSprG+Dm1cNYo2rjQ4I2OSdZsZDy8t4eNdhnwb2zev3x4+Xg6mo4Orn8+PGXT6kvO2\/oxf7BTziAhcy9oWd3e9Hhy4PZwSHt7+4f7r\/El4P9\/cPdl7vPaU\/s7u6Jg4jCECJysLe79\/wQo9Hh4W68G9Pn\/wLRIfww","commits":[{"patch":"","message":"DDT Yellow Challenger","timestamp":"2026-07-10 09:43:53"},{"patch":"@@ -1084,26 +1084,32 @@\n %0AHI \n-Y'ALL.\n+EVERYONE! IT%E2%80%99S ME\n  %7B%7BBB%7D%7D\n- HERE\n !%0A%0A%7B\n@@ -3131,8 +3131,62 @@\n w!%0A%0A\n+%7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0A(beat) Didn't two planes fly into each other?%0A%0A\n %7B%7BRF\n@@ -3226,17 +3226,16 @@\n nster.%0A%0A\n-%0A\n %7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0A(\n","message":"DDT July 10 2026 9:46","timestamp":"2026-07-10 09:46:46"},{"patch":"@@ -146,60 +146,8 @@\n %0A\/*%0A\n-%7B%7BBB = BIG BIRD%7D%7D%0A%7B%7BBW = BAD WOLF%7D%7D%0A%7B%7BRF = RED FOX%7D%7D\n %0A%0A%7B%7B\n@@ -307,31 +307,8 @@\n X%7D%7D%0A\n-%7B%7BC = CONSPIRACY GUY%7D%7D%0A\n %3E Ch\n@@ -389,1055 +389,307 @@\n NT. \n-STUDIO\n+Challenger%0A\n %0A%0A%7B%7B\n-C\n+RF\n %7D%7D%0AWe\n-lcome to our program %E2%80%9CWhat They Don%E2%80%99t You to Know%E2%80%9D. We show you things that nobody wants to talk about. Come join us as we show what really went down on January 28th 1986. Now this is based on an interview of a NASA Engineer who was responsible for the Challenger Mission. See how the public has been duped from the very beginning.%0A%0AINT. Challenger%0A%0A%0ANASA ENGINEER (V.O.)%0AAll units standing by%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D standing by%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D standing by%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D and %7B%7BRF%7D%7D hear some wrestling behind them%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D standing by%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0AWhat the fuck!%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D %5E%0AHoly shit! You shouldn't be here!%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0AHI EVERYONE! IT%E2%80%99S ME %7B%7BBB%7D%7D!%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D you are not supposed to be here! %7B%7BBW%7D%7D to %7B%7BC%7D%7D. %7B%7BBW%7D%7D to %7B%7BC%7D%7D. Stall the launch %7B%7BC%7D%7D.%0A%0ANASA ENGINEER%09%0ARoger. The launch has been stopped%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D%0AAwww how sweet! My kids love watching Sesame Street every Saturday morning! But you really shouldn't be here%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0AI know I shouldn%E2%80%99t be here but I love flying!\n+'re about to embark on the launch of the Challenger. This is a big day for America%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D standing by%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D standing by%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D and %7B%7BRF%7D%7D hear some wrestling behind them%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0AHI EVERYONE! IT%E2%80%99S ME %7B%7BBB%7D%7D!%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D I'm so happy you are here!!%0A\n %0A%0A%7B%7B\n-BW\n+RF\n %7D%7D%0A\n-I've heard rumors of The Yellow Menace. I thought it was a myth. \n Hey \n@@ -725,22 +725,17 @@\n BB%7D%7D%0AOh \n-%7B%7BBB%7D%7D\n+I\n  couldn'\n@@ -802,508 +802,392 @@\n e!%0A%0A\n-%7B%7BRF%7D%7D%09%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D to %7B%7BC%7D%7D. %7B%7BRF%7D%7D to %7B%7BC%7D%7D. %0A%0AThe crew only hears static%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D (CONT'D)%0ACome on KEVIN. Please resp\n+!%7B%7BRF%7D%7D and %7B%7BBW%7D%7D realize this is an issue%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0AI'm sorry what?%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D%0ADid you say door frame?%0A%0A%0AFeel the tensi\n on\n-d\n  bu\n-ddy.\n+ild\n %0A%0A%7B%7BB\n-W%7D%7D%0A(panicked)%0AHey man you really need to get out of here now!%0A%0ANASA ENGINEER (V.O.)%0A(statically)%0A-melia Ear-%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D%0AKEVIN? Did you say something? Did you say Amelia Earhart?! What did you say KEVIN? Come in KEVIN!%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%09%0AAMELIA EARHART! I know her! She's my friend! I haven't seen her in a bit! She taught me my love of flying!%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D%09%0AI'm so stressed out right now!\n+B%7D%7D%0ADon't worry I'll hide it for you! I don't want you guys to get in trouble%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D%0AThat's not it, it's -%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0AYou know this reminds me of hide and seek with my friend Amelia Earhart. I couldn't find her, so I left!%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0AWait you -%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D%09%0AOH god\n %0A%0A%7B%7B\n@@ -1425,22 +1425,17 @@\n  worry. \n-%7B%7BBB%7D%7D\n+I\n  will be\n@@ -1472,148 +1472,320 @@\n ys%0A%0A\n-NASA ENGINEER (V.O.)%0A(statically)%0A-indenburg-%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0Aindenburg. You don't mean-%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0AThe Hindenburg! That was the first ship I flew! You\n+a beat passes%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D%0A(defeated)%0AI guess we have no choice but to continue with our mission%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D and %7B%7BBW%7D%7D start fumbling with controls. A rumble is felt%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0AYay! We're going up like a balloon. You know, I remember a big balloon, the Hindenburg. I had so much fun with it, but then I popped it.%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0AI\n  hav\n@@ -1793,49 +1793,24 @@\n  to \n-let me fly this! I%E2%80%99m really experienced!%0A\n+get out of here!\n %0A%0A%7B%7B\n@@ -2026,65 +2026,8 @@\n ife?\n- That's all I want to know. That and if my family is okay\n %0A%0A%7B%7B\n@@ -2164,2266 +2164,1052 @@\n B%7D%7D%0A\n-Oh yeah! I love aviation so much that I flew two planes at once! It was the most fun I ever had until now!\n+(suddenly serious)%0AWe can't have that now can we?\n %0A%0A%7B%7BB\n-W%7D%7D%0A(beat) Didn't two planes fly into each other?%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D%0A(beat) Oh my god. You are a monster.%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0A(beat) I don't know what to say. I finally ran out of words to say%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D starts ripping out the wires%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0AToday's color is Blue. As in these blue wires shouldn't be touching the red wires. So I made sure that all the blue wires touch each other instead!%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0AThose are for our oxygen module! We need them so we can breathe in our shuttle while we are in space!%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D%0AI'm sorry %7B%7BBW%7D%7D. I don't have the strength to fight anymore. I have accepted my fate\n+B%7D%7D starts ripping out the wires to the comms module%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0A(beat) %0AWasn't that when two planes %5Bflew into each other%5D%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0AOne time I was playing tag at Tenerife! The other plane didn%E2%80%99t want to play tag, but I made them!%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D%0A(beat) %0AOh my god. You are a monster.\n %0A%0A%7B%7BB\n-B%7D%7D%0AThank you for letting me fly this for you! I can%E2%80%99t wait to become one with the sky again!%0A%0ANASA ENGINEER (V.O.)%0A(statically)%0ADeath has come for you-%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0AI can still fight. I can still get us out of here!%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0AI wish people would stop calling me that! I prefer the name %7B%7BBB%7D%7D! Death is bad%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0AYou son of a bitch! YOU SON OF A BITCH!%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D punches %7B%7BBB%7D%7D in the face%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0AHey now that hurt my feelings! I don%E2%80%99t like that! %0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D starts messing with the buttons%0A%0ANASA ENGINEER (V.O.)%0AThe countdown has been started. I'm so sorry %7B%7BBW%7D%7D and %7B%7BRF%7D%7D. 5 (beat) 4 (beat) 3 (beat)%0A%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D%0AOh god%0A%0ANASA ENGINEER (V.O.)%0A2 (beat)%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0AGoodbye everyone%0A%0ANASA ENGINEER (V.O.)%0A1%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D is going to fly again!%0A%0ANASA ENGINEER (V.O.)%0ALiftoff%0A%0A%3E**Black out**%3C%0A%0AINT. STUDIO%0A%0A%7B%7BC%7D%7D%0ASee how you the American Public was duped. The Challenger was doomed to fail. Many people may blame the stiff O-Rings, many people may also blame th\n+W%7D%7D%0A(beat) %0AI don't know what to say. I finally ran out of words to say%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0AI can still fight. I can still get us out of here! You son of a bitch! YOU SON OF A BITCH!%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D punches %7B%7BBB%7D%7D in the face%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0A(loses composure but becomes serious again)%0ADo you think that hurt my feelings?  You mistaken yourself that you are nothing more but playthings to me, mere puppets along for my ride. MY RIDE! Strung up by a sense of duty. But look at me (be\n at\n+)\n  there \n-was a lot of pressure from top management to launch on the January 28th 1986. Was %7B%7BBB%7D%7D also to blame for that as well? These questions are for next time on %E2%80%9CWhat They Don%E2%80%99t Want You to Know%E2%80%9D%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A\/*%0A%0AA light appears on a puppet like RONALD REAGAN eating a chicken leg%0A%0ARONALD REAGAN%0AThey wouldn't have called it the Challenger if it wasn't challenging. We mourn heroes, pioneers who honored us by living their lives. (Burps) Excuse me. Sorry folks. We'll continue our quest in space. This shuttle launch is brought to you by the letter C for Casualties\n+are no strings. This is nothing but a crack in my mask.%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D starts messing with the buttons%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0AThe countdown has been started. 5 (beat) 4 (beat) 3 (beat)%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D%0AOh god%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0A2 (beat)\n %0A%0A%7B%7BB\n-B%7D%7D appears behind Ronald Reagan as if he is %7B%7BBB%7D%7D's puppet%0A%0A*\/\n+W%7D%7D%0AGoodbye everyone%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0A1.%0A%0A%3E**BLACK OUT**%3C%0A%0A%0A\n %0A%3C__\n@@ -3233,11 +3233,11 @@\n h = \n-256\n+180\n , by\n@@ -3289,22 +3289,22 @@\n .. 5\n-6434171 4c773d\n+1565167 4b6938\n 3d %7D\n","message":"Big Bird became an absolute psychopath. I'm going to dial it back","timestamp":"2026-07-17 12:18:43"},{"patch":"@@ -323,63 +323,8 @@\n  %3C%0A%0A\n-Nasa Engineer%0ABad Wolf%0ARed Fox%0ABig Bird%0AConspiracy guy%0A\n %0A*\/%0A\n@@ -497,258 +497,443 @@\n %0A%7B%7BB\n-W\n+B%7D%7D%0A%7B%7BBB\n %7D%7D \n+st\n and\n- %7B%7BRF%7D%7D hear some wrestling behind them%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0AHI EVERYONE! IT%E2%80%99S ME %7B%7BBB%7D%7D!\n+ing by%0A%0A%0A%7B%7BBW%7D%7D%0AI'm so happy that you could make it %7B%7BBB%7D%7D!%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0AI%E2%80%99m so happy I could be here with my best friends%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D spills coffee on himself\n %0A%0A%7B%7B\n-BW\n+RF\n %7D%7D%0A\n+Oh no this is worst thing that could happen on the Challenger%0A%0A\n %7B%7BB\n-B%7D%7D I'm so happy you are here!!%0A%0A%0A%7B%7BRF%7D%7D%0AHey what's that in your hand?%0A%0A%7B%7BBB%7D%7D%0AOh I couldn't get through 